                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon, make 2 hit rolls instead of 1. Each time an attack made by this weapon is allocated to an enemy model, that enemy model cannot use any rules to ignore the wounds it loses.</characteristic>
