            <profile name="CORV Support" id="d4d3-8311-2587-1793" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit suffers Perils of the Warp, if this unit contains 1 or more CORV models, 1 of those models is destroyed and the effect(s) of that Perils of the Warp is ignored.

The destruction of a CORV model is ignored for the purposes of Morale tests. If this unit&apos;s GRIMNYR model is ever destroyed, all of this unit&apos;s remaining CORV models are also destroyed.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
