            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer&apos;s unit gains the MEDIC keyword. In addition, once per turn, the first time a saving throw is failed for the bearer&apos;s unit, the Damage characteristic of that attack is changed to 0.</characteristic>
