                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon, on an unmodified hit roll of 6, the target suffers D3+3 mortal wounds and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
