                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- The bearer knows one additional power from the Skeinwrought discipline.
- In your Psychic phase, if the bearer attempts to perform a psychic action, it can then still attempt to manifest one psychic power.</characteristic>
