                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD:
- That unit can ignore any or all modifiers to its Leadership characteristic.
- Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for that unit, you can ignore any or all modifiers.</characteristic>
