                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD fights, if it is within Engagement Range of any enemy CHARACTER or MONSTER units, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to this WARLORD&apos;s Attacks characteristic.
- Each time this WARLORD makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.
